---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AuthorBox from '../components/AuthorBox.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="Kile Research writes plain-language, reproducible guides to how AI models run, and helps small businesses adopt AI safely.">
  <div class="container section">
    <div class="page-prose">
      <h1>About Kile Research</h1>
      <p class="lead">We publish plain-language guides to how AI models actually run: on your own computer, how fast, at what cost, and with what trade-offs.</p>
      <h2>What we write</h2>
      <p>Our articles are for developers, IT teams and curious learners at beginner to intermediate level. Each one teaches a single idea, shows every step, and ends with something you can run and measure yourself.</p>
      <h2>How we write</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Reproducible.</strong> Every article links to its code in our <a href={site.codeRepo}>public GitHub repository<span class="visually-hidden"> (opens external site)</span></a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Honest about limits.</strong> We say what we tested on, and that your results may differ on other hardware.</li>
        <li><strong>Facts and opinions kept apart.</strong> We say what we measured, what the documentation says, and what we think it means.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Where we publish</h2>
      <p>This site is the home of our research. Some articles also appear on Medium, and those copies link back here.</p>
      <h2>Working with businesses</h2>
      <p>We also help small businesses put AI to work in a way that is practical, private and secure. <a href="/consulting/">See how we can help</a>.</p>
      <h2>Spotted a mistake?</h2>
      <p>Please tell us. <a href={`${site.codeRepo}/issues`}>Open an issue on GitHub<span class="visually-hidden"> (opens external site)</span></a> or <a href="/contact/">get in touch</a>. We correct errors openly and note each update on the article.</p>
      <AuthorBox id="kile-research" />
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
